# Quick Start Guide

Get up and running in 5 minutes!

## Step 1: Clone Repository (1 min)

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Ys1234lol/mushroom-robot-monitor.git
cd mushroom-robot-monitor
Step 2: Install Dependencies (2 min)
第 2 步：安装依赖项（2 分钟）
pip install -r requirements.txt
第 3 步：配置网络（1 分钟）
MODBUS_HOST = "YOUR_PLC_IP"        # e.g., 192.168.2.88
MODBUS_PORT = 502
MQTT_BROKER = "YOUR_MQTT_BROKER"   # e.g., 192.168.1.107
MQTT_PORT = 1885
python mushroom_robot_monitor.py
第 4 步：运行 1 分钟
✓ Connected to Modbus TCP
✓ Connected to MQTT broker
🚀 Mushroom Robot Monitoring System Started
第 5 步：检查输出结果
After running for 5 minutes, Ctrl+C to stop:
运行 5 分钟后，按 Ctrl+C 键停止：

bash
# View log
cat logs/mushroom_robot_monitor.log
# View waveforms
ls -la logs/waveforms/
# Open HTML report
open logs/reports/report_*.html
